dio_recovery: F52 (R84a): the VACASK corpus's demo/spice/dio.sim, a diode's reverse recovery (tt=1u, cjo=50n) from 1 V to -1 V at 0.2 us; refined to span/2000 the two still differ (i(v1) at 0.5 us: ngspice-45 1.1157, VACASK 1.2138 A; VACASK converges at first order toward about 1.154), so the harness's refinement does not class it
load "spice/diode.osdi"
model v vsource
model d sp_diode rs=1.0 is=1e-9 tt=1e-6 cjo=50n bv=5 ibv=1e-6
v1 (1 0) v type="pulse" val0=1 val1=-1 delay=0.2u rise=1n fall=1n width=1
d1 (1 0) d
control
  analysis tran1 tran step=0.1u stop=1u
endc
